# COPY to .vercelignore before a PLATFORM CLI deploy (cp .vercelignore.platform .vercelignore).
# NOT committed as .vercelignore: the web project builds from this same root via git,
# and excluding /web starved its builds into a 7-second empty shell whose check PASSED.
# Platform (Python API) deploy. Root-anchored (a bare name also matches subpaths —
# `evals` swallowed aughor/evals once). data/ ships ONLY its authored inputs
# (glossary, KB, rules): the empty-catalogue goal means no generated stores, and
# per-connection artifacts are keyed to local connections that don't exist there.
# `/data/*` not `/data`: gitignore semantics cannot re-include under an excluded DIR.
/web
/data/*
!/data/kb
!/data/glossary.yaml
!/data/global_rules.md
!/data/events.yaml
!/data/metrics.json
/tests
/evals
/docs
/scripts
/scratchpad
/.venv
/node_modules
/.git
/.github
/.pytest_cache
/.ruff_cache
*.duckdb
*.db
